        "original_id": "e0ac324f-5ff2-540e-a80f-c156d527512e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nate Diaz, Joe Lauzon\n- Organizations: World Extreme Cagefighting, Strikeforce, Pancrase, Zuffa, Ultimate Fighting Championship\n- Topics: mixed martial arts, post-fight bonus awards\n\nFacts:\n- World Extreme Cagefighting was an American mixed martial arts promotion founded in 2001.\n- Zuffa, LLC, the parent company of the Ultimate Fighting Championship, purchased World Extreme Cagefighting in 2006.\n- Prior to signing with the Ultimate Fighting Championship, Nate Diaz competed in World Extreme Cagefighting, Strikeforce, and Pancrase.\n- Joe Lauzon is tied with Nate Diaz for the most post-fight bonus awards in Ultimate Fighting Championship history.",
